      "title": "STEPS Farm Worker Full-Time",
      "description": "University of Kentucky Applicant Site | STEPS Farm Worker Full-Time Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Sign Up For Job Alerts! Log In /Create Account Help Applicant Support STEPS Farm Worker Full-Time Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details Posting Details Job Title STEPS Farm Worker Full-Time Requisition Number TE09284 Department Name 81140:Veterinary Science Work Location Lexington, KY Salary Range $17.00/hour Type of Position Temporary Position Time Status Full-Time Required Education Required Related Experience Required License/Registration/Certification Physical Requirements Pushing and lifting up to 50 lbs, working outside with horses. Shift Work Shift Shift coordinated with supervisor. Could require weekends/holidays. Expected # of Hours Per Week 37.5 Job Summary The Veterinary Department at UK is seeking a STEPS Farm Worker Full-Time to horse care and general farm maintenance at our North Farm. This includes: Daily care and feeding of horses, Mowing Weedeating Other duties as assigned Thank you for your interest in working at the University of Kentucky! Skills / Knowledge / Abilities Farm experience Does this position have supervisory responsibilities? No Preferred Education/Experience Deadline to Apply 12/31/2026 Our University Community We value the well-being of each of our employees and are dedicated to creating a healthy place for everyone to work, learn and live. In the interest of maintaining a safe and healthy environment for our students, employees, patients and visitors, the University of Kentucky is a Tobacco & Drug Free campus. The University follows both the federal and state Constitutions as well as all applicable federal and state laws on nondiscrimination. The University provides equal opportunities for qualified persons in all aspects of institutional operations and does not discriminate on the basis of race, color, national origin, ethnic origin, religion, creed, ag