    "https://ukjobs.uky.edu/postings/649467": {
      "title": "Extension Custodian - Hopkins County",
      "description": "University of Kentucky Applicant Site | Extension Custodian - Hopkins County Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Sign Up For Job Alerts! Log In /Create Account Help Applicant Support Extension Custodian - Hopkins County Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details Posting Details Job Title Extension Custodian - Hopkins County Requisition Number DU15124 Department Name 81W04: KCES Region West Area 04 Work Location Madisonville, KY Salary Range $15.61 to $18.00 Type of Position Temporary Position Time Status Part-Time Required Education High school /GED Required Related Experience No Experience Required Required License/Registration/Certification Driver’s license required. Physical Requirements Ability to sweep, mop, vacuum, operate floor scrubber/buffer, and perform other cleaning duties. Ability to lift, push, pull and carry objects up to 50 lbs. Ability to engage in regular/routine standing, walking, squatting, bending, reaching, climbing. Ability to work outdoors in inclement weather. Shift Monday-Friday (8:00 a.m. – 4:30 p.m.); up to 20 hours per week; occasional nights, weekends or holidays may be required Job Summary Job Title: Extension Custodian – Hopkins County Location: Madisonville, KY As an Extension Custodian, you will be responsible for the overall maintenance, cleanliness and other basic custodial aspects of the Extension office. General duties include facility management, cleaning, maintenance, basic landscaping, conference room set up, and general repairs while conducting yourself in a professional manner. Specific duties will include, but are not limited to, cleaning, stocking, and maintaining bathrooms and kitchen areas; vacuuming and dusting entire office area; emptying trash and recyclables; maintaining and cleaning outdoor areas; occasional duties such as stripping and waxing floors; changing light bulbs; steam cleaning carpets; landscaping, mowing and weed eating outside areas; and setting up conference rooms. You will report to an Extension Agent and there will be some interaction with the general public. State law may require a national and state criminal background check and a letter from the Cabinet for Health and Family Services stating the employee is clear to hire based on no findings of substantiated child abuse or neglect found through a background check of child abuse and neglect records as a condition of employment or involvement in this program. Salary Range: $15.61 – $18.00 Skills / Knowledge / Abilities Does this position have supervisory responsibilities? No Preferred Education/Experience Some previous experience in the maintenance/janitorial field. Deadline to Apply 10/13/2026 Our University Community We value the well-being of each of our employees and are dedicated to creating a healthy place for everyone to work, learn and live. In the interest of maintaining a safe and healthy environment for our students, employees, patients and visitors, the University of Kentucky is a Tobacco & Drug Free campus. The University follows both the federal and state Constitutions as well as all applicable federal and state laws on nondiscrimination. The University provides equal opportunities for qualified persons in all aspects of institutional operations and does not discriminate on the basis of race, color, national origin, ethnic origin, religion, creed, age, physical or mental disability, veteran status, uniformed service, political belief, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, pregnancy, marital status, genetic information or social or economic status. Any candidate offered a position may be required to pass pre-employment screenings as mandated by University of Kentucky Human Resources. These screenings may include a national background check and/or drug screen. Posting Specific Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * Do you or a family member serve as a member on any county Extension District Board in Kentucky?  If yes, please state the family member’s name and the county for which either you or this individual serves as a member of the Extension District Board. (Open Ended Question) * Where did you first see this position advertised? UK jobs, UK's online employment system (ukjobs.uky.edu) Newspaper Handshake Received an email about the posting Social Media Friend or Family Journal of Extension Indeed.com Other online job board Other * Do you have a valid driver's license and are you able to drive? Yes No Applicant Documents Required Documents Optional Documents Resume Cover Letter 805 Las Cimas Parkway Suite 400 Austin, Texas, 78746 © University of Kentucky Lexington, Kentucky 40506 An Equal Opportunity University Accreditation Directory Email Privacy Policy Copyright © Faber To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
