    "https://ukjobs.uky.edu/postings/633398": {
      "title": "Pharmacy Sr Tech I/OnCall/UKHC - Pediatric Pharmacy",
      "description": "University of Kentucky Applicant Site | Pharmacy Sr Tech I/OnCall/UKHC - Pediatric Pharmacy Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Sign Up For Job Alerts! Log In /Create Account Help Applicant Support Pharmacy Sr Tech I/OnCall/UKHC - Pediatric Pharmacy Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details Posting Details Job Title Pharmacy Sr Tech I/OnCall/UKHC - Pediatric Pharmacy Requisition Number DU11270 Department Name H3330:Pharmacy Services Work Location Lexington, KY Salary Range $18.50/hr - 27.31/hr Type of Position Temporary Position Time Status On Call Required Education High School Required Related Experience 2yr pharmacy or related experience Required License/Registration/Certification National Pharmacy Technician Certification and Registration with Kentucky Board of Pharmacy Physical Requirements May include standing for greater than 5 hours at a time. May require the ability to reach items above shoulder level and be able to lift up to 30 pounds. Shift The successful candidate must be able to work various shifts (first shift, second shift, third shift) and be available to work 1-2 weekends per month year round. Must be able to help cover extra shifts during the summer and during holiday breaks. Rotation will include at least one summer and one winter holiday. Job Summary Assists pharmacists in providing medications to patients in Kentucky Children’s Hospital. Prepares and delivers individual patient doses. Prepares and delivers batch doses including compounded sterile products. Participates in replenishing automated dispensing cabinets; provides customer service in Pediatric Pharmacy Satellite. Skills / Knowledge / Abilities Knowledge of inpatient drug distribution systems; ability to prioritize; strong customer service skills. Does this position have supervisory responsibilities? No Preferred Education/Experience hospital pharmacy experience preferred. Deadline to Apply 12/31/2026 Our Universi