    "https://ukjobs.uky.edu/postings/619974": {
      "title": "Student Internship- Soil Microbiology",
      "description": "University of Kentucky Applicant Site | Student Internship- Soil Microbiology Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Sign Up For Job Alerts! Log In /Create Account Help Applicant Support Student Internship- Soil Microbiology Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details Posting Details Job Title Student Internship- Soil Microbiology Requisition Number DU14396 Department Name 81060:PLANT AND SOIL SCIENCES Work Location Lexington, KY Salary Range Varies Type of Position Student Position Time Status Part-Time Required Education N/A Required Related Experience n/a Required License/Registration/Certification n/a Physical Requirements Willingness to work outdoors, occasionally in adverse weather conditions. Shift Will be discussed with supervisor. 20 hrs. a week Job Summary Paid position in soil microbiology research Help with a variety of soil microbiology projects and gain skills in scientific research PART - TIME (20 HOURS / WEEK ) MAY - AUGUST 2026 QUESTIONS ? DR. ERNIE OSBURN E.OSBURN@UKY. EDU Skills / Knowledge / Abilities Does this position have supervisory responsibilities? No Preferred Education/Experience Prior greenhouse experience preferred, though enthusiasm/willingness to learn is most important! Deadline to Apply Our University Community We value the well-being of each of our employees and are dedicated to creating a healthy place for everyone to work, learn and live. In the interest of maintaining a safe and healthy environment for our students, employees, patients and visitors, the University of Kentucky is a Tobacco & Drug Free campus. The University follows both the federal and state Constitutions as well as all applicable federal and state laws on nondiscrimination. The University provides equal opportunities for qualified persons in all aspects of institutional operations and does not discriminate on the basis of race, color, national origin, ethnic origin, religion, creed, age, physica