      "title": "General Internal Medicine Clinical Physician",
      "description": "University of Kentucky Applicant Site | General Internal Medicine Clinical Physician Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Sign Up For Job Alerts! Log In /Create Account Help Applicant Support General Internal Medicine Clinical Physician Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details Posting Details Job Title General Internal Medicine Clinical Physician Requisition Number FE04817 Working Title Department Name 7H359:INTERNAL MEDICINE & DIVISIONS - GENERAL Work Location Lexington, KY Type of Position Faculty Position Time Status Full-Time Tenure Track Status Non-Tenure Track Required Education MD Degree or equivalent Required Related Experience Residency training as well as experience as a clinical physician Required License/Registration/Certification Board certified or eligible in Internal Medicine Ky Medical License Job Summary The University of Kentucky College of Medicine Department of Internal Medicine is seeking a Clinical Physician for an opportunity in an ambulatory setting in the Division of General Internal Medicine, Newtown Pike Clinic. This position will have a full clinical faculty appointment, competitive compensation and benefits. Qualified applicants must be board eligible or board certified in internal medicine or family medicine. UK HealthCare is located in the beautiful Bluegrass Region of Lexington and is an ideal location to experience the work-life balance we strive to provide for all our employees. Lexington, KY is consistently ranked nationally in the top sectors for Business and Careers (Forbes), Young Professionals (Kiplinger), and Education (Parenting). Please include a CV along with application. Applications will be reviewed immediately and continue until the position is filled. Skills / Knowledge / Abilities Does this position have supervisory responsibilities? No Preferred Education/Experience Board certified in Internal Medicine Deadline to Apply Open Until Filled Yes Our 